"t71r_secask":{"history_id":16465505,"link":"https://www.pangram.com/history/2bd10917-a93c-4902-b95d-60c94c172d9d","utc":"2026-10-18T03:59:49Z","words":1434,"avg_ai_likelihood":0.12597666680812836,"headline":"AI Detected","version":"4.0","windows":["Human, High, 245","AI-Generated, High, 180","Human, High, 1009"],"flagged":["AI-Generated (180 words): Feeling it once is a long way from feeling it only when you're tripping, and that's still a long way from feeling it on a regular morning while the coffee brews.\nThat one amazing night can turn into a hook, too, if it becomes the bar and regular life starts to feel like failing. How intense or beautiful it was doesn't prove that what you saw really happened, or that you're done healing. I'd watch what's different once it wears off. Are you any more honest? More protective of your little one, more reliable? Those are the souvenirs worth keeping (way better than the T-shirt).\nAnd if your little one still can't take the love in, even after all that? Don't crank up the intensity, or go hunting for another big breakthrough to push it through. Something's in the way, so get curious about that instead. Maybe a protective part doesn't trust it yet. Maybe love used to come with strings attached, and it still looks like a trap."]},
